{"resourceIdentifier":"5016","resourceName":"Longhai New Hope manure management project","description":"Longhai Swine Farm AWMS GHG Mitigation Project (hereafter referred to as the project) introduces a set of new animal waste management systems (AWMSs i.e. Enclosed Anaerobic Digester, the same below) to treat the manure from the swine farm in Xiling Village, Dongsi Township, Longhai District, Zhangzhou City, Fujian Province, China, P. R. China, which are owned by Longhai New Hope Liuhe Agriculture and Animal Husbandry Co., LTD. The purpose of the project activity is to treat the manure and wastewater on site to avoid methane emissions generated in the baseline uncovered anaerobic lagoons.\r\nIn this project, the swine farm installed one AWMS to replace the traditional uncovered anaerobic lagoon. All the manure and wastewater are collected into the collection tanks and then be separated into solid and liquid matters firstly. And the separated liquid will be sent into an anaerobic digester called an Upflow Anaerobic Sludge Bed reactor (UASB). The biogas generated during the anaerobic treatment process will be captured and total 1380*104 m3 biogas are expected to be generated annually. Biogas is then sent into biogas boiler for heat production. The biogas boiler has been installed in the swine farm. All of the heat generated are used by AWMS. The sludge produced by anaerobic digestion is processed by aerobic composting along with separated solids to produce organic fertilizer which is sold to fertilizer companies and finally used for land application, while the effluent is used for agricultural irrigation.","location":{"latitude":24.338211,"longitude":117.780761},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2024-05-07","endExclusive":"2024-06-07","endInclusive":"2024-06-06"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"5016"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Fujian Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"113596"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Livestock, enteric fermentation, and manure management"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0010"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"27/03/2025"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 11/01/2023 - 10/01/2033"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=112419&IDKEY=f98klasmf8jflkasf8098afnasfkj98f0a9sfsakjflsakjf8dk155025801","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PD_PCP_5016_13MAR2024.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-05-07T18:37:07.143Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=109642&IDKEY=a0e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9m151196318","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Listing-Representation-Multiple-PPs-v4.2-Longhai Project.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-03-14T06:39:13.577Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=129592&IDKEY=k98klasmf8jflkasf8098afnasfkj98f0a9sfsakjflsakjf8df178707368","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS PDMR 5016 11JAN2023- 30APR2024-v4-clean .pdf","uploadDate":"2025-03-27T07:36:54.15Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=124585&IDKEY=3iquwesdfm